        "text": "That's a good start; two changes is plenty for now. One more thing: weigh yourself every morning, after the toilet and before breakfast, and write it down. If your weight goes up by two kilograms in three days, or you're more breathless or swollen, ring the heart failure nurse or your GP that day."
