        "text": "Here's your first appointment: two fillings and a crown on the lower back tooth. The written plan you signed shows the NHS charge. At the crown appointment, my note says we discussed a tooth-coloured ceramic crown instead of the NHS metal one, and you preferred tooth-coloured. It says cost was discussed verbally. There's no updated written estimate."
