        "text": "Your hunger is real, and honestly it's a good sign. Water, tea, coffee and sugar-free squash you can have whenever you like. And instead of three small meals, we can split the same amount into six smaller ones, so you're never waiting long. What you can't do yet is add extra food from the shop or from visitors."
